      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The present application has been filed for the following main relief:-\nFor the facts, reasons and circumstances mentioned in the accompanying affidavit it is most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may kindly be pleased to set aside the impugned summonsing order dated 4.11.2022 issued by the learned Judicial Magistrate Purwa Unnao, in Criminal Misc. Case No. 535/2022 (Aradhana Devi versus Rakesh Kumar & others) under sections 498A, 323, 504, 506 I.P.C. & 3/4 Dowry Prohibition Act pertaining to Police Station Purwa District Unnao pending in the court of Judicial Magistrate Purwa Unnao during the pendency of the instant petition to secure the ends of justice.",
