    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": ". \nSri Alok Kumar Srivastav, learned Counsel for the applicants says that matrimonial dispute between opposite party no.2 and Rakesh Kumar s/o Shiv Mangal has been settled and therefore, the present application filed by Rajendra Kumar, Madhuri Devi and Shubham, who are brother-in-law (Jeth), Sister-in-law (Jethani) and nephew (Bhatija) of the informant/opposite party No. 2, may be dismissed as withdrawn.\nTo the aforesaid prayer, learned A.G.A. has no objection.\nAccordingly, the present application is dismissed as withdrawn.\n(Saurabh Lavania,J.) September 2, 2025 Jyoti/-\n \nRajendra Kumar And Others vs State Of U.P. Thru.",
